---
import OmarLayout from '../layouts/OmarLayout.astro';
---
<OmarLayout title="Maths & science lessons" description="Personal online maths and science tuition for GCSE Foundation, GCSE Higher and A-level. Start a lesson enquiry with Omar.">
  <section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Online lessons / 05</p><h1>Maths & science.<br />Made clear.</h1><p class="lede">Personal online lessons for GCSE Foundation, GCSE Higher and A-level. Build a method you understand, not just an answer you remember.</p><a class="text-link lesson-start" href="#lesson-enquiry">Start a lesson enquiry ↗</a></section>
  <section class="section booking-layout" id="lesson-enquiry">
    <aside class="booking-summary"><p class="eyebrow">Your starting point</p><h2>A little about you.<br />A better first conversation.</h2><p>I’m a Maths & Physics Teaching Assistant at Southfields Academy and a Computer Science & Mathematics student at Birkbeck.</p><div class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">Lesson brief</p><p class="summary-value" data-summary-subject>Choose your subject</p><p data-summary-level>Then tell me your level.</p><p class="fine-print">Online · Pricing and availability agreed directly</p></div><p class="fine-print">If you’re under 18, involve a parent or guardian in arranging lessons. Please do not include a school name, home address or sensitive personal information.</p><a href="mailto:omerapoua0@gmail.com">Prefer a simple email? ↗</a></aside>
    <div class="booking-form panel"><noscript><h2>Let’s talk about lessons.</h2><p>Email your subject, level and what you would like help with to <a href="mailto:omerapoua0@gmail.com">omerapoua0@gmail.com</a>. The guided form needs JavaScript, but email works without it.</p></noscript>
      <form data-enquiry="lessons" hidden>
        <div class="form-progress" data-progress><span class="step-label" data-step-label>Step 1 of 4</span><progress value="1" max="4" aria-label="Enquiry progress">1 of 4</progress></div>
        <fieldset class="form-step" data-step><legend tabindex="-1">What are we tackling?</legend><p>Pick a subject. We can explore the details together.</p><div class="choice-grid">
          <label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="subject" value="Maths" required /><span class="choice-content"><span class="choice-glyph" aria-hidden="true">∑</span><strong>Maths</strong><small>Patterns, problems and a method that makes sense.</small></span></label>
          <label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="subject" value="Science" required /><span class="choice-content"><span class="choice-glyph" aria-hidden="true">⚛</span><strong>Science</strong><small>Tell me the science subject and topics you need.</small></span></label>
          <label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="subject" value="Maths & science" required /><span class="choice-content"><span class="choice-glyph" aria-hidden="true">+</span><strong>A little of both</strong><small>We’ll find a useful balance.</small></span></label>
        </div></fieldset>
        <fieldset class="form-step" data-step><legend tabindex="-1">Which level are you studying?</legend><p>Choose your current course, not the grade you hope to reach.</p><div class="choice-grid">
          <label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="level" value="GCSE Foundation" required /><span class="choice-content"><span class="choice-glyph" aria-hidden="true">01</span><strong>GCSE Foundation</strong><small>Build the foundations, one clear step at a time.</small></span></label>
          <label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="level" value="GCSE Higher" required /><span class="choice-content"><span class="choice-glyph" aria-hidden="true">02</span><strong>GCSE Higher</strong><small>Connect concepts and tackle unfamiliar problems.</small></span></label>
          <label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="level" value="A-level" required /><span class="choice-content"><span class="choice-glyph" aria-hidden="true">03</span><strong>A-level</strong><small>Go deeper into reasoning and exam technique.</small></span></label>
        </div></fieldset>
        <fieldset class="form-step" data-step><legend tabindex="-1">What would help most?</legend><div class="field-grid"><label class="field">Your main goal<select name="goal" required><option value="">Choose your focus</option><option>Build confidence and understanding</option><option>Prepare for exams</option><option>Work towards a higher grade</option><option>Catch up on specific topics</option></select></label><label class="field">Preferred days<select name="days" required><option value="">Choose a preference</option><option>Weekdays</option><option>Weekends</option><option>Flexible</option></select></label><label class="field">Preferred time<select name="time" required><option value="">Choose a preference</option><option>Morning</option><option>Afternoon</option><option>Evening</option><option>Flexible</option></select></label><label class="field">Time zone<input name="timezone" value="Europe/London" maxlength="60" required /></label></div><label class="field">A little more context <span>(optional)</span><textarea name="message" rows="3" maxlength="700" placeholder="Your exam board, science subject, a difficult topic or an upcoming exam"></textarea></label><p class="fine-print">These are preferences, not reserved lesson times. We will agree lesson length, availability and pricing by email.</p></fieldset>
        <fieldset class="form-step" data-step><legend tabindex="-1">Who am I saying hello to?</legend><div class="field-grid"><label class="field">Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="80" required /></label><label class="field">Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="150" required /></label></div><label class="field">You’re enquiring as<select name="relationship" required><option value="">Choose an option</option><option>A student</option><option>A parent or guardian</option></select></label><p class="notice">This page prepares an email. It does not submit or store your enquiry. Your details stay here until you choose to open or copy the draft.</p></fieldset>
        <div class="form-actions" data-navigation><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-back>← Back</button><button class="button" type="submit" data-next>Continue →</button></div>
        <section class="form-review" data-review hidden aria-labelledby="lesson-review-title"><p class="eyebrow">Ready for your review</p><h2 id="lesson-review-title" tabindex="-1">A good place to begin.</h2><p>Your brief is ready. <strong>Nothing has been sent.</strong> Open your email app, review the draft and send it from there.</p><label class="field">Your prepared enquiry<textarea data-draft rows="12" readonly></textarea></label><div class="form-actions"><a class="button" data-email href="mailto:omerapoua0@gmail.com">Open email draft ↗</a><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-copy>Copy enquiry</button><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-edit>Edit details</button></div><p class="fine-print">No email app? Copy this brief into an email to <a href="mailto:omerapoua0@gmail.com">omerapoua0@gmail.com</a>.</p></section>
        <p class="form-status" data-status id="lesson-form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section grid-2"><div><p class="eyebrow">How we work</p><h2>Understand the why.<br />Practise the how.</h2><p>We start with where you are, break an idea into manageable steps and try a fresh problem. The aim is a method you can use independently.</p></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>Which subjects and levels can I enquire about?</summary><p>Maths and science at GCSE Foundation, GCSE Higher and A-level. Tell me your exact science subject, exam board and topics so we can confirm a good fit.</p></details><details><summary>How much do lessons cost?</summary><p>Lesson length, pricing and availability are agreed directly once we have discussed what you need. No payment is taken on this website.</p></details><details><summary>Is this a confirmed booking?</summary><p>No. You prepare and send an enquiry, then we agree a suitable time together.</p></details><details><summary>Can parents and guardians enquire?</summary><p>Yes. Use your own contact details and choose “A parent or guardian” in the final step.</p></details></div></section>
  <script>import '../scripts/forms';</script>
</OmarLayout>
